@type project
@title Field Notes
@summary A publishing platform for independent writers.

# About

Field Notes is a publishing platform designed for independent writers who want a simple place to publish their work.

I developed the front-end and design system used across the site, with an emphasis on readability, consistency, and flexible content.

The interface was intentionally kept out of the way so that writing remained the focus.

# My Role

I worked on the front-end architecture and translated the visual language into a reusable set of components.

I also helped establish typography, spacing, and layout patterns that could be shared across articles, author pages, and supporting content.